  "metadata": {
    "title": "Workflow 2 - Image Vault Generator",
    "description": "Batch generates vault images using Z-Image Base + trained character LoRA + IPAdapter identity lock. 2-step pipeline (generate + refine) with YOLOV11m face detailing. 4 lanes with bundle support. Optimized for RTX 5090.",
    "version": "3.0",
    "author": "AI Influencer Pipeline",
    "gpu_target": "RTX 5090 32GB",
    "docker_image": "comfyui:latest-5090",
    "images_per_character": 800,
    "lanes": ["sfw", "suggestive", "spicy", "nsfw"]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [50, 50],
      "size": [450, 280],
      "properties": {
        "text": "WORKFLOW 2: IMAGE VAULT GENERATOR\n====================================\nGenerates 800 images per character (200 per lane)\n\nLanes: SFW | Suggestive | Spicy | NSFW\nPer lane: 80 one-offs + 10x3 + 10x5 + 4x10 bundles\n\nPIPELINE:\n1. Load character's trained LoRA\n2. Load identity reference image (face_01)\n3. Apply IPAdapter for face consistency\n4. Generate from vault manifest prompts\n5. Face detail + film grain + upscale\n6. Auto-save with organized naming\n\nUSAGE:\n1. Set character LoRA in LoRA loader\n2. Set reference image path\n3. Paste prompts from vault manifest\n4. Queue for batch generation\n\nOPTIMIZED FOR: RTX 5090 32GB VRAM\nBATCH MODE: Process prompts sequentially via API"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "UNETLoader",
      "pos": [100, 380],
      "size": [300, 80],
      "title": "Z-Image Base UNET (6B)",
      "widgets_values": ["z_image_bf16.safetensors", "default"],
      "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "links": [1]}]
    },
    {
